<title>JAPAN: Japan Jan lead imports up 69.1 pct year/year--MOF.</title>
<headline>Japan Jan lead imports up 69.1 pct year/year--MOF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's refined lead imports in January rose 69.1 percent to 2,529 tonnes from 1,496 tonnes in the same month a year earlier, Finance Ministry data issued on Friday showed.</p>
<p>The following is a breakdown (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		    Jan 97	    Dec 96	   Jan 96</p>
<p> Total	    2,529		 877	    1,496</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> China	    1,824		 192		250</p>
<p> Peru		 370		 265		274</p>
<p>Cumulative imports in 1996 were 33,334 tonnes, down a steep 55.5 percent from 74,824 tonnes in 1995.</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
